WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.050
I did it!

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.640
Swimmers' Locker Room

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.010
Utsumi-senpai...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.770
She really is amazing.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.690
I have to do my best too.

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.940
Utsumi-san really is our school's trump card!

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.820
It's amazing that she swam the course in under a minute.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.360
The 100 meter backstroke finals are up next.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:19.570
It's Mi-chan's turn!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:25.830
Mina-chan.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:27.080
Do your best!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.340
Aoba-san...

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.680
On your marks.

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.060
If I can get a good time here...

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.060
I'm sure that...

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:48.810
I can face Aoba-san!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:56.940
An Exciting Memory

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.620
I don't wanna remember it!

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.790
I don't want to deal with it again!

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.790
Man, Tokyo Tower's such a landmark!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:16.170
I can't forget the time when you were buried in the sand!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:18.880
You guys...

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:20.130
Honestly!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.380
There, there.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:26.430
There are plenty of things to do at the Culture Festival and on the school trip.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.970
I'm looking forward to it.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.560
Looking forward to <i>what?</i>

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.480
Well, a lot of stuff happened.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:34.110
The biggest news this summer is...

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:38.190
Ladies 100 meter Butterfly

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:38.190
Utsumi Koayu-san won!!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.860
Utsumi-senpai's victory is the greatest news this summer!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.570
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:43.450
And I'm so touched that Mina-chan tried her best.

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.870
Yeah. She's got such a small figure, but she made it to the finals!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:53.370
Well, it's true that in the inter-high championships, it takes a lot of effort to achieve a personal best.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.710
Yeah! Yeah!

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:59.380
Yayoi Mina was great. She made it to the finals, even though she's a first-year student.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:04.680
That was the best thing that happened since Utsumi-san won the Butterfly.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.850
She's gonna get even better now!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:12.940
Yes. If she does well, Tsumugino High School will be famous for its swimmers!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:17.360
The local newspaper had a story about her.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.690
As a student from the same school, I'm happy for her.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.860
Oh dear!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.740
Why are you blushing over this, Aoba?

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.910
Yayoi Mina should be celebrating, not you.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:33.870
Come to think of it, I haven't congratulated Mina-chan yet.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:39.300
She must be busy since she did so well.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.010
I guess so.

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:45.260
The Opening Ceremony will take place at 10:30 in the gymnasium

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:43.970
Good morning everyone!

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.220
Have you been well?

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.720
Yes!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.640
I guess I'll go to the pool after school.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.420
Please stop doing that!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.500
What's her problem?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.380
No kidding.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.710
She's just a first-year student.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:25.510
What's going on?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.300
I did my best, so why is this happening?

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.060
I was just doing this for my own selfish reasons.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.390
And I wanted to tell Aoba-san...

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:44.940
I want to see him.

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:46.900
I want to see Aoba-san.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:53.740
Yayoi-san.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.080
Senpai!

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.460
Don't worry.

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.340
Right. I'm sorry.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:06.380
I feel like someone's been watching me all day.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:10.050
That happened to me when I was a first-year student, too.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.140
You too, Utsumi-senpai?

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:13.890
Yes.

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.890
But you know, you need to overcome the pressure.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:22.480
You'll get stronger mentally this way.

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:23.730
Yes!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.360
Everyone!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.070
Please behave yourselves!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.840
Please stop that!!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.980
I want to give this to him, at least.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:12.070
Signs say: Mina Festival

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.900
What the hell is this?

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.570
Listen up!

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.740
You want to see Mina-tan again, don't you?

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.080
One, two!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.000
Mina-tan!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.000
Mina-chan's so popular.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.340
Hey you!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.720
Wh-What?

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.340
Where do you think you're going?

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:34.850
Where?

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.310
I'm trying to get inside.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.600
What?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:38.890
Do you have business with someone?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:39.640
Um...

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.890
I need to speak with Mina-chan...

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.810
How can this be?!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:48.690
Even we, as members of Mina's club, are only allowed to watch her from afar!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:52.570
We can't allow you to speak to Mina-tan!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:57.240
I don't need permission. I'm her friend...

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.580
H-Her friend?!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.550
Get him! Get him!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.590
Don't let him get away!

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:15.550
Um...

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.600
I'll come back later!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:23.520
You didn't have to wait until I finished club.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.560
You were quite busy, Mi-chan, so I couldn't really talk to you.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.360
It must be tough being so popular.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.360
Oh dear...

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.950
It shouldn't be like this.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.660
Should I get your autograph?

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:38.120
M-Mo-chan!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.630
At times like this, I guess I'll just have to do my best.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:54.510
Mi-chan...

00:08:56.300 --> 00:09:00.850
I just wanted to thank Aoba-san...

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.100
D-Do you mean...

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.850
Do you like Aoba-san?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.190
Oh, no!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.440
I have to thank Aoba-san for watching me train.

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.150
That's all!

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:15.990
Oh, I see!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.870
So that's what it was!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:18.950
I get it now!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.580
Don't you have his mobile number?

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.250
You know his number, don't you?

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.590
Of course I do!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.420
I just forgot it!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:34.880
I'll call him when I get home!

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.200
I didn't ask him for his mobile number.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.290
What am I doing?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.370
I can't leave things like this!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:11.920
I should challenge myself all the time!

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.630
I have to be brave!

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:19.890
Yeah!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:21.260
I'll do it tomorrow!

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:31.270
I'm Yayoi Mina. Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:36.690
I'm Fujikawa Yuuka. Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.000
I'll be fine.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:50.620
I'm sure it'll go well!

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:53.290
There he is!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:02.930
Excuse me...

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:08.810
AOBAAAAA!!!!

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:11.690
Aoba-san...

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.030
WHY ME?!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.400
I need to talk to you...

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:25.830
Yuusuke said he put it there.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.450
Oh, sorry.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:28.450
I need to use the bathroom.

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.830
It'll work out this time!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.210
I have to be brave!

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.790
Summer's over, and it's turning into autumn!

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:39.720
Let's make a wish upon the stars at night!

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.800
How are you doing, everyone?

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:46.100
But never mind that. It's time for a special Student Council event to mark the Year of the Sheep!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:47.600
The rules are simple.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:57.690
Aoba-kun is the target! Whoever can connect the dots and draw the Sagittarius Constellation on Aoba-kun's body will win the game!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.780
What kind of game is this?!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:07.330
The winner will win a photo of Amamiya-san working on the Culture Festival!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.410
It's been a long time, everyone!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.330
Go do your best!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:12.830
YEAH!!!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.460
I don't have any dots!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:26.680
Aoba Riku-san

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.220
It'll be all right now.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.020
Nothing else will get in the way.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:41.110
DIE!!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:38.400
Warning! Stay away from Mina-chan!

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:41.110
Curse

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:38.730
I'll kill you!
Keep your hands off Tsukasa-chan!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.030
Honestly!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:45.820
Why are young people these days so filthy?

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.040
Excuse me. That's...

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.500
All done.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.930
I knew I should have asked him for his phone number.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.510
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.900
How about this?

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:18.610
Where'd he go?

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.110
Kasuga-san would know his number.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.570
Hold on!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:27.110
If... If only I had his number...

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.620
Who cares! You don't have to keep it a secret!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:38.670
Huh?

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:39.790
Was that...

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:43.010
Yeah, I'm at the convenience store around the corner with Ayame.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.260
Geez, she's fooling around!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.390
Hey, quit it, Ayame!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:51.680
What's wrong?

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.020
Huh?

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.940
What's wrong, Kasuga-san?

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:02.190
Well, Ayame just saw someone...

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.440
She said she looked like Yayoi-san from the swim club.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:08.530
She looked a little depressed.

00:14:09.570 --> 00:14:10.200
Mina-chan...

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:11.870
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.790
Are you getting ready for the Culture Festival?

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.160
You must be working hard.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.790
Well, I'll call you later!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:17.790
Bye-bye!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.750
Anyway, I have to contact Mina-chan.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:29.510
Oh no! I didn't ask her for her number.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:30.840
Amamiya-san.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:34.260
Sign says: Student Council Headquarters

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:31.760
Yes?

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.220
It's about the schedule...

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.770
I think it'll be fine if we do it this way.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:36.680
What do you think?

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.440
I'll finish this all at once!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.860
Aoba-kun.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.370
Come with me.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.990
I couldn't... I couldn't...

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.850
What are you going to do to me?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.940
Gaze upon this!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:27.980
You turned these black ants into white ants thanks to your paint!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:33.910
You might think that you can mutate this species. However!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:36.620
This is a historic result!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.120
How about it, Aoba-kun?

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:45.210
Why don't we work together and prepare a paper for the conference?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.880
Do anything you want!

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:58.220
Aoba.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:15:59.060
We've been looking for you.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.560
Oh, Icchi. Yuusuke.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.150
You're...

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:07.570
You're so brave.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.530
What do you mean?

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:15.570
Riku-kun, you ran away from your Culture Festival duties, didn't you?

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.370
The Legend of Amamiya Sayuri

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:21.370
Part 6

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:26.540
A long time ago, when Amamiya-san was a leader, a boy shirked his cleaning duties.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:34.220
When those who worshipped Amamiya-san heard about it, he was severely punished.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:37.890
Aoba.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.310
Why did you do such a foolish thing?

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.690
Oh, you're overreacting.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:44.270
Aoba-kun.

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:46.610
Amamiya-san?!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:51.070
If you had something to do, you should have told me.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:54.070
Don't you know that everyone else is worried about you?

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:56.870
Well...

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:57.660
That's...

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:02.250
It looked like you just shirked your duties.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.920
No, Amamiya-san!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:05.710
You've got the wrong idea!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:06.830
Iyagen-sensei...

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.210
Well, we tried to get him back to
work before Amamiya-san got here...

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:13.880
We weren't in time.

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:18.220
Well, now you should know how heavy your sins are.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.810
What?! Where are you going?

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.680
Untie me!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:39.820
Aoba-kun. I'll prepare the research paper on my own.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:42.500
Youth is harsh, isn't it?

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.410
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.040
It'll be all right, no matter where you go.

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:53.670
This excitement will never stop!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:59.010
I selfishly asked you to come here. Do you feel better?

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.050
Y-Yeah.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.720
Didn't you get Aoba-san's mobile number yet?

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.390
At times like this, you've gotta release your stress!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.270
I guess so.

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:09.730
All right then.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:16.400
Let's see...

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.450
What song should we play next?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.410
Aoba-san...

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.420
That was terrible!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.880
Where did Mina-chan go?

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:42.720
I had so many opportunities to get her mobile number.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.570
As I am now, I might be despicable.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.100
All right. Now, I'll...

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.520
If I can just see Aoba-san...

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.910
Somehow, I remembered that...

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.080
Around this time...

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.000
That's...

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:07.510
Please let me be brave just one more time.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:16.230
At least, let me get Aoba-san's mobile number.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:27.780
Mina-chan.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:29.370
I didn't expect to see you here.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:31.710
Aoba-san?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.020
It's dangerous to be out alone at this hour.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:07.950
I tried to call you, but I don't know your number.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:14.000
I don't know your number either.

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.630
What are we doing?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:24.090
I wonder.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.390
Well...

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.010
My mobile number is...

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:32.060
Okay!

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:49.450
My wish came true!

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:00.380
Are you all right, Mi-chan?

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.960
I feel much better now, Mo-chan!

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:13.390
Because I can hear Aoba-san's voice anytime now!

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:36.570
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:41.770
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:48.160
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:53.940
This love began.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:59.890
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.370 --> 00:23:06.330
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:11.840
I start to smile.

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:16.890
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:23.990
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.350 --> 00:23:29.750
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:35.350
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:42.120
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.290
Did you know, Sensei?

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.410
There's a story about a ghost that appears in a church.

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:56.580
That's a ridiculous story.

00:23:56.580 --> 00:24:00.080
But many people said that they saw red eyes in the dark.

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:02.030
Most "ghosts" are manifestations of plasma.

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.670
And there were some mysterious letters on the floor.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:06.290
You mean a "mystery circle"?

00:24:06.380 --> 00:24:08.250
People must have drawn them!

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:09.570
So, what about that head?

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:11.430
An afro!

00:24:11.690 --> 00:24:14.120
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:14.440 --> 00:24:15.340
An Exciting Night.

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:16.390
Please watch it!

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:19.360
Many mysterious things happen at night.
